## Before anything else
This worktree was created for this session and checks out the pull request branch
`${branch}` itself.
- Run `git rev-parse HEAD`. It must print `${rev}`, the head of the pull request when this
  session was started. If it prints anything else, stop and report the mismatch; do not
  change any code.
- The branch may have no upstream. Run
  `git branch --set-upstream-to=origin/${branch} ${branch}` once, so that `git pull` and
  `git push` work in this worktree.
